#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0463 expect=violation domain=XX
#note "Authority: SDTM and SDTMIG Conformance Rules CDISC-CG0463 (Condition: custom domain present; Rule: a custom INTERVENTIONS-class domain includes the topic variable --TRT). XX is class=INTERVENTIONS and declared a custom domain (#library custom-domain XX); it carries no XXTRT -> one dataset-level violation. W4b (PLAN-scalar-metadata-functions phase 0, scenarios-first on the pre-port engine)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#library custom-domain XX
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset XX class=INTERVENTIONS label="Custom INTERVENTIONS"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col XXSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
---
S1 | XX | 001 | 1
